    "result_text": "Done. The full suite is green (`BUILD SUCCESS`).\n\nI implemented the customerCode de-duplication in `AssignOwnerCustomerCode.java`:\n\n- It computes the base code `<REGION>-<HASH8>` as before.\n- It now also takes the `OwnerRepository`, collects the `customerCode`s of all existing owners (excluding the owner being saved, matching the pattern used in `RejectDuplicateIdentity`/`CountOwnerNamesakes`).\n- If the base code collides, it appends `-<n>` starting at `n=2` and increments to the smallest value that produces a code not already in use, then assigns the de-duplicated code to the owner.\n\nThe acceptance test `coreCustomerCodesStayUnique` (and the rest of the suite) passes.",
